you want to control the exact raster versions used in the analysis.

For package-managed/default raster downloads, use \code{\link[=bf_enrich_raster_context]{bf_enrich_raster_context()}}
instead.

This function currently supports three optional raster-context groups:

\describe{
\item{\code{"worldcover"}}{Extracts an ESA WorldCover-style categorical raster,
returning \code{worldcover_class}, \code{worldcover_label} and \code{worldcover_year}.}
\item{\code{"soilgrids"}}{Extracts one or more named continuous SoilGrids-style
